tps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2968168925","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104382#issuecomment-2968168925","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104382","id":2968168925,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6w6qnd","user":{"login":"Grublady","id":29121925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTIxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29121925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady","html_url":"https://github.com/Grublady","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T21:12:11Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T21:12:11Z","body":"Added the documentation as requested. Rebased to current master.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2968168925/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3354305391","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104382#issuecomment-3354305391","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104382","id":3354305391,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7H7qNv","user":{"login":"unfa","id":491704,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTcwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/491704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unfa","html_url":"https://github.com/unfa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unfa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unfa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unfa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unfa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unfa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unfa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unfa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unfa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unfa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-01T01:04:51Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T01:12:12Z","body":"I think I have hit my toe on this.\r\n\r\nI have spend like 3+ hours just today trying to understand what in my code makes rigid body collision sounds only play for what sounds like 50 ms chunk, and then get cut off.\r\n\r\nTurned out my code was fine, and the problem was that I had an active Reverb Zone effect on an Area where the AudioStreamPlayer3D was.\r\n\r\nWhat seems like one buffer length of each sound effect playback goes to the original bus, but the rest is sent to the reverb bus exclusively. The reverb bus in my project is turned down by like 40 dB to only provide ambience, because I have **assumed** that the reverb effect will only send a COPY of the audio signal to the reverb bus, rather than leave one buffer's length on the original SFX bus and then **redirect** the rest to the reverb FX bus where I was unable to hear it.\r\n\r\nVideo proof that I am not crazy:\r\nhttps://youtu.be/t9yTuwDPtTM\r\n\r\nNow that I think about it, I see where a lot more of the problems with SFX playout I had were coming from :thinking: \r\n","author_association":"NONE","reacti