":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4960902729","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104382#issuecomment-4960902729","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104382","id":4960902729,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ7FeSQ","user":{"login":"Akosmo","id":95504962,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFKQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95504962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo","html_url":"https://github.com/Akosmo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T17:45:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T17:45:32Z","body":"Ah I see, you're right, it does end up sounding different compared to other builds. Not sure why it sounds like that... it does deserve an investigation. It sounds noisy to me.\r\n\r\nJust to note: while it makes sense to have `dry` set to 0 in this PR, since the dry signal is being sent to a different bus, in the older build, `dry` should be non-zero, since otherwise you'd only hear the `wet` signal. See if in that case, the sound is the same. It could be caused by how `dry` and `wet` signals mix in the reverb effect.\r\nAlso if you have the time, make sure that no other configuration isn't causing this, including outside the reverb effect.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4960902729/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]